NAME='Mercury'
COVER_SUB='How your mind works in each sign.'
T=[
("Quick-witted","Mercury in Aries thinks fast and speaks first. You decide quickly, enjoy a debate and get bored with long explanations. Ideas arrive as sparks, and you are happiest starting a project, not finishing it. You say what you mean, sometimes before you have checked it. The shadow is impatience, interrupting and arguing for the sport of it. The lesson: a good idea survives a pause."),
("Slow and sure","Mercury in Taurus thinks slowly and deliberately. You take time to form an opinion, and once you have one it is hard to move. You learn through the senses, by touching, tasting and repeating, and you have a practical mind with a good memory for what is useful. Your voice is often calm and pleasant. The shadow is stubbornness and resistance to new information. The lesson: changing your mind is a sign of strength."),
("Own sign","Mercury is at home in Gemini: the mind is quick, curious and playful. You read, talk, write and learn constantly, and you can follow several conversations at once. Words are your tools, and you are witty, adaptable and good at explaining. You collect information the way others collect objects. The shadow is scattering, gossip and knowing a little about everything. The lesson: depth is also a kind of cleverness."),
("Feeling mind","Mercury in Cancer thinks with the heart and remembers with the stomach. You pick up moods before words, and your memory for personal details, family stories and emotional history is excellent. You communicate best with people you trust and may go quiet when you feel unsafe. The shadow is taking things personally and talking in circles around a worry. The lesson: say the feeling out loud, plainly."),
("Dramatic","Mercury in Leo speaks with warmth, confidence and a sense of occasion. You are a natural storyteller, you like big ideas and you want your words to matter. Teaching, performing and leading come easily. You are generous in conversation and proud of your opinions. The shadow is talking over others and hating to be corrected. The lesson: listening is also a form of leadership."),
("Own sign and exalted","Mercury is both at home and exalted in Virgo, its strongest place. The mind is precise, analytical and attentive to detail. You see what needs fixing, organise information well and enjoy craft, health, language and systems. You are modest in how you speak and hard on your own mistakes. The shadow is worry, nitpicking and paralysis by analysis. The lesson: a useful answer is better than a perfect one."),
("Fair-minded","Mercury in Libra weighs both sides before it speaks. You are tactful, diplomatic and a good mediator, with a taste for elegant language and balanced arguments. Thinking is easier in conversation than alone. You dislike harsh words and rude people. The shadow is indecision and telling people what they want to hear. The lesson: fairness sometimes means taking a side."),
("Probing","Mercury in Scorpio digs under the surface. You are investigative, perceptive and drawn to secrets, psychology, mysteries and anything others avoid. You listen more than you speak and rarely say everything you know. Your words can cut or heal with equal precision. The shadow is suspicion, sarcasm and withholding. The lesson: share what you have found, not only what you have noticed."),
("Detriment","Mercury in Sagittarius is in detriment: the mind sees the big picture but can miss the details. You think in ideas, beliefs and possibilities, you love to teach and to travel, and you speak with enthusiasm and honesty. You can overpromise and generalise. The shadow is preaching and skipping the fine print. The lesson: check the facts before you announce the truth."),
("Practical","Mercury in Capricorn thinks in plans, structure and consequences. You are serious, disciplined and good at long-term strategy, and you speak economically. Humour is dry, and your mind improves with age. You trust experience over theory. The shadow is pessimism, rigidity and a cold tone. The lesson: encouragement is also useful information."),
("Inventive","Mercury in Aquarius thinks in systems, patterns and original ideas. You are objective, curious about the future and comfortable with unconventional opinions. Science, technology and community interest you more than small talk. You enjoy sharing ideas with groups. The shadow is intellectual detachment and being right at the cost of being close. The lesson: a new idea also needs a human audience."),
("Detriment and fall","Mercury in Pisces is in detriment and in fall: the mind works by intuition, imagery and feeling, not by logic. You absorb impressions, think in pictures and music and are gifted with poetry and empathy. Facts can slip away and plans become fog. You understand people better than schedules. The shadow is vagueness and avoiding hard conversations. The lesson: write it down and say it clearly."),
]
